# The manual pilot image needs only its package and pinned dependencies. The
# Workbench image needs its runtime and pinned UI snapshot, but not its docs,
# Compose files or captured API-source copy; API source comes from its base image.
# Exclude the checkout's ignored secrets, virtualenv, Git data and graph index.
**
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!src/**
!ops/
!ops/manual-pilot/
!ops/manual-pilot/Dockerfile
!ops/manual-pilot/requirements.txt
!ops/runtime-ui/
!ops/runtime-ui/runtime_ui.py
!ops/runtime-ui/asset-pins.json
!ops/runtime-ui/navigation.html
!ops/runtime-ui/ui/
!ops/runtime-ui/ui/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
